# OPUS GUBERNATIO PARTICIPANT PACKAGE og-participant-2026.08-v16
#
# SUCCESSOR to og-participant-2026.08-v15, whose checksum record is preserved unchanged at
# code_audit/run44_participant_package_v15_checksums.sha256 and is pinned to the commit whose
# blobs it describes, fe2e2df. This record describes the LIVE TREE.
#
# RUN 47, THE EVM CONSISTENCY CHECK. TWO of the seventy files moved, and NEITHER IS
# SEQUENCE-BEARING. That is stated first because it is what a reader most needs to know.
#
# assets/js/detail.js -- the executive brief panel renders, as TEXT, every relation where one
# document stated both a value and the percentage that determines it against a known budget at
# completion and the two do not agree. The block is deterministic: it is read from the stored row
# the server already served, not from the generated brief, so it cannot be lost to a cached
# brief, a model refusal or a regenerate. It states what disagrees and by how much, names the
# document that stated both figures, and stops; it does not say which figure is wrong and it does
# not tell the reader what to conclude. It carries no band, no colour and no severity. The same
# file's BRIEF_CAT_LABEL carried ten entries in the retired "Cat N" scheme against
# NAMING_AUTHORITY.md:96; the ten label values are now groups and purposes only.
#
# assets/js/recommendation_options.js -- the same text beside the recommendation, on both the
# available and the unavailable branch of the courses-of-action card. Nothing about the
# recommendation itself moves: its key, its title, its reason and its evidence are assembled
# without reference to it, and the card states in its own words that nothing there changes the
# recommendation above.
#
# NO USER-FACING CONTROL WAS ADDED, MOVED OR REMOVED. Both rendered blocks were measured in the
# real browser DOM and contain zero controls of any kind: no button, no input, no select, no
# textarea, no link and no element with a button role. The executive brief panel still carries
# exactly the one control it carried before, its regenerate button.
#
# NO STORED FIGURE MOVED AND NOTHING IS DERIVED INTO STORAGE. The comparison is a pure function
# called on the READ path from the stored row. The document takes precedence: `pv` and `ev` are
# stored exactly as the document stated them.
#
# NO SERVER COMPUTATION MOVED. The full served census -- every module result, every category
# status, every band, every colour, every posture and every abstention -- is IDENTICAL with and
# without a disagreement present. The populations are unchanged: 101 registered, 63 in service,
# voting exactly A1.7 and A1.8.
#
# THE EXPERIMENTAL SEQUENCE IS UNCHANGED. decision.js, decision-ui.js, workspace.js, deepdive.js
# and both questionnaires are byte for byte identical to v15. The v15 record is NOT regenerated:
# it is pinned to the commit whose blobs it describes.
#
